{
  "root_id": "499379061718659073",
  "label": "non-rumour",
  "event": "ferguson-all-rnr-threads",
  "thread_type": "non-rumours",
  "num_nodes": 57,
  "num_edges": 56,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "post_id": "499379061718659073",
      "text": "Quiet where I am. Lots of talking. Lots of standing. No smash-smash. #Ferguson http://t.co/dXiIc5EQqq",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:17:00 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499420927604834304",
      "text": "@so_treu @mattdpearce A few parks, a small lake.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 05:03:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993810769013883e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500131590140203009",
      "text": "Suburban Tahrir.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:07:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013047586044314e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500134505366454272",
      "text": "Self-regulated, self-organized — we're basically talking about an anarchist space.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:18:52 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.00131590140203e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499435414189395969",
      "text": "@DougMeigs @mattdpearce @urbanphoto_blog Thanks for the tip, Doug!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 06:00:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993884663003382e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499450537272938496",
      "text": "@mattdpearce The corporate space as a stealer of public/collective space? Think there are social/architectural theories about it.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 07:01:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938041668018995e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499541715985104897",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Given long history of relations btwn forms of (sub)urban space &amp; forms of political practice in them. From Haussmann onwards.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 13:03:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.995407344802488e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499445805040680960",
      "text": "...and that's how .@mattdpearce's excellent coverage of race in America today through the lens of #Ferguson lead to commentary on urbanism.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 06:42:13 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938070900638925e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499410967881859073",
      "text": "Check out the excellent Twitter thread on #Ferguson by @mattdpearce. @GreatDismal",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 04:23:48 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993800493849723e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499540734480248832",
      "text": "@mattdpearce this would be a really interesting thing to write about at more length, when you have a chance to catch your breath.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 12:59:26 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499633285853896706",
      "text": "@mattdpearce All public lands are public spaces; we have an absolute constitutional *and* inalienable right to redress grievances in them.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 19:07:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500143732604141568",
      "text": "@mattdpearce any news from QT on the future of that store?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:55:32 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499380864011485184",
      "text": "Very profound question/observation. @mattdpearce",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:24:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938041668018995e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499402421601595393",
      "text": "@mattdpearce How do you collect petition signatures in the suburbs? Not so easy either, as learned in MO-wide initiative on payday loans.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 03:49:50 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938070900638925e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500135991852941312",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Temporary Autonomous Zone http://t.co/vZC0YVl5Pq",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:24:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001345053664543e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499380049384972288",
      "text": "And I realize that's partly because the street has become a square. Because the police have partially boxed it in.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:20:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993797366241321e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499411779622297601",
      "text": "“@mattdpearce: One of the stranger elements of covering all this is seeing major demonstrations expressed in a suburban context.” #Ferguson",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 04:27:01 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500138548230897664",
      "text": "@mattdpearce thank you for your work tonight.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:34:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499388271135576065",
      "text": "@mattdpearce @jjfantauzzi Kettling?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:53:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993800493849723e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500168385624166400",
      "text": ".@mattdpearce \"You can go now, Officer\"? Eerily reminds me of scene from #Homeland book by @doctorow Tear gas balloons enter stage right?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 06:33:30 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993790617186591e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500160080495771649",
      "text": "@OccupyToronto mark, TWWWWWWAAAAAIIIIN. -runsaway-",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 06:00:30 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001593471049605e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500131815319805952",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Remind me, which penal code section is smash-smash?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:08:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993790617186591e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499380416680189952",
      "text": "Would we be here if the police weren't here? Or is the QuikTrip a de facto park because it's burned down, and no longer corporate space.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:22:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993800493849723e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499542325421678592",
      "text": "@mattdpearce v. interesting to compare protest &amp; militatized policing in those sorts of urban landscapes to the ones of American surburbia.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 13:05:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.995418109228073e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500135646259052544",
      "text": "Those spaces are usually really fun and sometimes euphoric but can run into problems when entropy sets in.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:23:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001345053664543e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500130475860443136",
      "text": "Remember all that stuff I was tweeting about suburban public space? This has been most radical redefinition of it I could imagine.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:02:52 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938070900638925e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499396511659089920",
      "text": "@mattdpearce @nickpistor interesting commentary...Zucotti wasn't the best spot for the Occupy protest, was it.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 03:26:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993797366241321e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499541810922807296",
      "text": "@kitabet which I am completely unaware of :)",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 13:03:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.995417159851049e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500131548382130176",
      "text": "@mattdpearce thanks for your tweets the past few days. You've helped immensely.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:07:07 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013047586044314e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499380709006389249",
      "text": "Well, here we are, and nobody's kicking us out, exactly. So. Suburban public space.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:23:33 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938041668018995e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499577295292887041",
      "text": "@mattdpearce You'll find historical perspective in this book from @MikeKellyColumn. A similar case in Teaneck, 1991: http://t.co/OdcuPuBDc1",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 15:24:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938251381120614e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499384183458775040",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Taksim in another example. The images &amp; violence in #Ferguson are reminding me on Turkey last yr. So disturbing.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:37:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993797366241321e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500159347104960512",
      "text": "Dear @justinstoned, we hereby bequeath into you the title of 'Honourary Member of #OccupyToronto\" for your wise and sage advice. #ows",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 05:57:35 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001544610050253e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500141680553504768",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Your tweets tonight have been amazing. Pure prose in a time of chaos. #journalismisrelevantagain",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:47:23 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499379482902286336",
      "text": "One of the stranger elements of covering all this is seeing major demonstrations expressed in a suburban context.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:18:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993790617186591e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499388466300338176",
      "text": "I retweeted out of order, but @mattdpearce has interesting comments on public space &amp; Ferguson riots FYI @dewolfleloup @urbanphoto_blog",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:54:23 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993797366241321e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500163995048095744",
      "text": "@mattdpearce @GreatDismal just like Temporary Autonomous Zone http://t.co/MITREgMItI http://t.co/n2QHme4Nun Is Hakim Bey on #NSA watchlist ?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 06:16:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013564625905254e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499419220850245632",
      "text": "@so_treu @mattdpearce #Ferguson is a small municipality. Homes, businesses, schools, church's- no separate space for demonstrations.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 04:56:35 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993810769013883e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499381076901388289",
      "text": ".@mattdpearce and how many parks/open public spaces are even in that area to begin with, i wonder.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:25:01 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993797366241321e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499380291065348096",
      "text": "We don't really have pedestrian squares in the US, only a l'il in NYC @mattdpearce",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:21:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993800493849723e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499633793809281024",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Further, acts of agents provocateur are treason.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 19:09:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499633554234413058",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Every and any attempt by govt to limit legitimate, non-violent protest in public spaces is unconstitutional.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 19:08:16 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500138208370638848",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Matt, you're blowing people's minds, dude. BTW please did anyone check the CCtv video from the McD, for arrests?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:33:35 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500146960674721794",
      "text": "@mattdpearce Thanks so much for the coverage, Matt. I'm relieved to see things have settled down a bit.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 05:08:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499379736624132097",
      "text": "In cities you rally in parks, in squares. Tahrir. Maidan. Zucotti. Here, we're standing in the street, outside a QuikTrip.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:19:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499382179479044096",
      "text": "Now everybody's a bit wired up because a woman almost tried to drive through the police line. http://t.co/bW8pYzmnZO",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:29:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938070900638925e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500132988340817921",
      "text": "@mattdpearce please write something long on that.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:12:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013047586044314e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499391244142129152",
      "text": "@mattdpearce pretty good reason to burn down a QuikTrip imo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 03:05:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938041668018995e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499542026241974273",
      "text": "@mattdpearce more than happy to send you links! much said about this stuff more recently in relation to Midan Tahrir, Kiev's Maidan, etc.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 13:04:34 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.995418109228073e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499435347164426240",
      "text": "Follow @mattdpearce on Ferguson riots: \"One of the stranger elements ... is seeing major demonstrations expressed in a suburban context.\"",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 06:00:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9937948290228634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500144049982951424",
      "text": "@mattdpearce @Yamiche these people and you",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:56:48 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001361207439114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500154461005025280",
      "text": "welcome to the occupy model. your perspective has been radicalized. this is not a protest this is a process. @mattdpearce @GreatDismal",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 05:38:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013047586044314e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499381680533422081",
      "text": "^^ Interesting train of thought on public space and protest by @mattdpearce",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:27:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9938070900638925e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500149160658468865",
      "text": "If you haven't already, you should read @mattdpearce's thoughts from tn on suburban public space in #Ferguson",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 05:17:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993790617186591e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500160350688669696",
      "text": "@OccupyToronto i hate joining stuff. my mouth &amp; bleeding heart always gets me kicked out of things. #BTW im not a liberal, thank you. #lulz",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 06:01:34 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.001593471049605e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500136120743911424",
      "text": "But like, these people are going to remember this night for the rest of their lives. And that's culture.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 04:25:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0013564625905254e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499382513811206144",
      "text": "Cops shouted at her. The men in the street told her to turn around, and then drifted toward the cops. Lots of jawing now.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 02:30:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.993821794790441e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
  ],
